      "text": "Frontend: CDN/Vercel, preview\ndeploy per PR\nServices: GitHub Actions → image\n→ Argo CD canary, SLO auto-rollback\nTerraform; multi-region active-\nactive reads, DR replicas\nOpenTelemetry traces + SLOs",
