    {
      "id": "text-1099",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 56,
      "y": 1098,
      "width": 1355.64,
      "height": 48.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#555",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1099,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 7700,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The clone is the \"Web\" client's listing page: a static React SPA (Vite) served from a CDN (Vercel). Listing data lives in src/data/listing.js, shaped like the\nListing / Reviews / Availability responses a BFF would return, so swapping it for a fetch is a local change. Photo tour and lightbox state is URL-addressable\n(?modal=PHOTO_TOUR_SCROLLABLE&modalItem=…), which is what lets SSR/ISR render the same overlay deep links and the CDN cache them per URL.",
      "originalText": "The clone is the \"Web\" client's listing page: a static React SPA (Vite) served from a CDN (Vercel). Listing data lives in src/data/listing.js, shaped like the\nListing / Reviews / Availability responses a BFF would return, so swapping it for a fetch is a local change. Photo tour and lightbox state is URL-addressable\n(?modal=PHOTO_TOUR_SCROLLABLE&modalItem=…), which is what lets SSR/ISR render the same overlay deep links and the CDN cache them per URL.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
